      "id": 4,
      "type": "grafana-echartsrelations-panel",
      "title": "4 \u2014 A byName min/max override on one node",
      "description": "**The domain is per-mark addressable, like colour and unit.**\n\nPanel-wide `min: 0 / max: 100` as in panel 2, plus a `byName` override giving **`db`** a domain of `0\u2013200`. Its median of 85 is 85% of 100 (red) but only 42% of 200 (green), so `db` alone changes step while the other three are untouched.\n\nUseful because a relations mark **is** a field: one node measured on a different scale to its neighbours can be graded on its own terms without splitting the query.",
